#: ../../quick-reference.rst:1
msgid "Part XIII: Quick Reference Card"
msgstr "الجزء الثالث عشر: بطاقة مرجع سريع"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:4
msgid ""
"Keep beside a terminal: build, run, configure, route, observe, and "
"diagnose. Part XII holds the full tables; this card holds what an "
"operator types."
msgstr ""
"أبقِ هذه البطاقة بجانب الطرفية: البناء، والتشغيل، والإعداد، والتوجيه، "
"والمراقبة، والتشخيص. يضم الجزء الثاني عشر الجداول الكاملة، وتضم هذه "
"البطاقة ما يكتبه المشغل."

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:6
msgid "Build"
msgstr "البناء"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:9
msgid ""
"cargo build --release -p sibuna                          # daemon + "
"SQLite + console + JLV + ACME\n"
"cargo build --release -p sibuna --no-default-features    # in-memory, no "
"external crate\n"
"cargo build --release -p sibuna --features postgres-tls  # shared "
"PostgreSQL clusters\n"
"rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown   # or set SIBUNA_POW_WASM / "
"SIBUNA_CONSOLE_WASM\n"
"cargo test            # unit, live daemon, storage and console tests\n"
"cargo clippy --all-targets && cargo fmt --check\n"
"cargo xtask check     # 70-line / 1,408-line / 99-column gate\n"
"cargo xtask browser   # headless Chromium checks\n"
"cargo xtask bench product   # whole products under wrk -> "
"benchmarks/results/\n"
"guidedog build        # this book (guidedog dsc: the SID records)"
msgstr ""
"cargo build --release -p sibuna                          # ⁧البرنامج "
"الخدمي + SQLite + وحدة التحكم + JLV + ACME⁩\n"
"cargo build --release -p sibuna --no-default-features    # ⁧في الذاكرة، "
"بلا أي حزمة خارجية⁩\n"
"cargo build --release -p sibuna --features postgres-tls  # ⁧عناقيد "
"PostgreSQL المشتركة⁩\n"
"rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown   # ⁧أو اضبط SIBUNA_POW_WASM / "
"SIBUNA_CONSOLE_WASM⁩\n"
"cargo test            # ⁧اختبارات الوحدات والبرنامج الخدمي الحي والتخزين "
"ووحدة التحكم⁩\n"
"cargo clippy --all-targets && cargo fmt --check\n"
"cargo xtask check     # ⁧فحص حدود 70 سطرًا / 1,408 سطرًا / 99 عمودًا⁩\n"
"cargo xtask browser   # ⁧فحوص Chromium بلا واجهة⁩\n"
"cargo xtask bench product   # ⁧المنتجات كاملة تحت wrk -> "
"benchmarks/results/⁩\n"
"guidedog build        # ⁧هذا الكتاب (guidedog dsc: سجلات SID)⁩"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:22
msgid "Run"
msgstr "التشغيل"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:25
msgid ""
"# Shield (default): PoW + WAF, proxy to :3000\n"
"sibuna -p 8080 -u 3000 -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# Gate: PoW only\n"
"sibuna --gate -p 8080 -u 3000 -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# Forward auth behind Nginx/Caddy (trusts X-Forwarded-For)\n"
"sibuna -m forward_auth --host 127.0.0.1 -p 8080 -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# Edge: persistent policies, reputation, forensics in <dir>/sibuna.db\n"
"sibuna -D /var/lib/sibuna -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# JA4 from a trusted ingress (Cloudflare's header; nginx module: x-ja4; "
"ATS: ja4)\n"
"sibuna --ja4-header cf-ja4 --trust-forwarded -p 8080 -u 3000 -s "
"/etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# Cluster member: shared PostgreSQL, unique node id\n"
"sibuna --database-url-file /etc/sibuna/database-url --cluster-node 1 -s "
"/etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"head -c 32 /dev/urandom | xxd -p -c 64 > /etc/sibuna/secret"
msgstr ""
"# ⁧Shield (الافتراضي): PoW + WAF، مع التمرير إلى المنفذ 3000⁩\n"
"sibuna -p 8080 -u 3000 -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# ⁧Gate: إثبات العمل فقط⁩\n"
"sibuna --gate -p 8080 -u 3000 -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# ⁧forward auth خلف Nginx/Caddy (يثق بـ X-Forwarded-For)⁩\n"
"sibuna -m forward_auth --host 127.0.0.1 -p 8080 -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# ⁧Edge: سياسات دائمة وسمعة وأدلة جنائية في ⁦<dir>/sibuna.db⁩⁩\n"
"sibuna -D /var/lib/sibuna -s /etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# ⁧JA4 من وكيل دخول موثوق (ترويسة Cloudflare؛ وحدة nginx: x-ja4؛ ATS: "
"ja4)⁩\n"
"sibuna --ja4-header cf-ja4 --trust-forwarded -p 8080 -u 3000 -s "
"/etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"# ⁧عضو في عنقود: PostgreSQL مشتركة ومعرّف عقدة فريد⁩\n"
"sibuna --database-url-file /etc/sibuna/database-url --cluster-node 1 -s "
"/etc/sibuna/secret\n"
"head -c 32 /dev/urandom | xxd -p -c 64 > /etc/sibuna/secret"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:41
msgid "Edge load balancer"
msgstr "موازن الحمل على الحافة"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:44
msgid ""
"sibuna lb --bind :8080 --server 10.0.0.1:80 --server 10.0.0.2:80   # no "
"file needed\n"
"sibuna lb --bind :8080 --server 10.0.0.1:80 --print-config > edge.jlv\n"
"sibuna lb --bind :8080 --server 10.0.0.1:80 --firewall shield --health "
"/healthz --admin /run/sibuna/edge.sock --access-log stdout\n"
"sibuna lb --proto tcp --bind :2222 --server 10.0.0.8:22\n"
"sibuna lb --proto udp --bind 192.0.2.10:53 --server 10.0.0.53:53       # "
"UDP binds a specific IP\n"
"sibuna lb --tls auto --domain example.org --server 10.0.0.1:80     # "
"automatic HTTPS (ACME)\n"
"sibuna check -f edge.jlv           # or edge.json: validate topology, "
"certificates, CA files\n"
"sibuna --config-file edge.jlv      # serve TCP, UDP and HTTP frontends\n"
"kill -HUP \"$(pidof sibuna)\"        # reload routes, policy and "
"certificates in place\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock show servers                      # "
"needs global.admin_socket\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock show stats                        # the "
"Prometheus text of the edge\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock help                              # "
"every command\n"
"/opt/sibuna/new/sibuna --config-file edge.jlv   # with "
"global.upgrade_socket: replaces the running daemon, no connection lost "
"(Linux)\n"
"sibuna lb --tls auto --domain localhost --server 10.0.0.1:80       # the "
"same from the local authority\n"
"sibuna lb --tls auto --domain staging.example.org --acme-issuer internal "
"--server 10.0.0.1:80   # a public name from the local authority\n"
"sibuna lb --tls auto --domain example.org --acme-on-demand-ask "
"http://127.0.0.1:9000/ok --server 10.0.0.1:80   # more names on demand\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock show certs                        # "
"certificates of tls.auto and on demand, and their OCSP staples\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock show ca > sibuna-root.crt         # the "
"root to install in clients\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock revoke cert db.corp.internal      # a "
"certificate of the local authority, or its serial\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock show hooks                        # "
"plugins: calls, verdicts, failures, open breakers (SID 0030)\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock set server app/10.0.0.1:80 state drain   "
"# or ready\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock set server app/10.0.0.1:80 weight 5\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock set server app/10.0.0.1:80 state drain "
"local   # this node only\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock del ban 203.0.113.9                      "
" # on every node of a mesh\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock reload cluster                           "
" # this node, then its peers\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock show cluster                             "
" # the file digest or revision of every node\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock show affinity                            "
" # the sticky table and the shares of fleet-wide limits\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock add server app/blue 10.0.0.3:80\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock del server app/blue\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock reload                            # as "
"SIGHUP, with the result\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock reopen log                        # "
"after logrotate renamed the access log\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock show info | grep spill            # the "
"disk tier of the sticky table: file, cost, counters\n"
"sibuna authority diff -c /etc/sibuna/node.json -f edge.jlv         # what "
"apply would change in the database\n"
"sibuna authority apply -c /etc/sibuna/node.json -f edge.jlv --expect 7 "
"--note \"add web3\"   # publish revision 8, or DBA002\n"
"sibuna authority history -c /etc/sibuna/node.json --limit 20       # the "
"revisions, newest first\n"
"sibuna authority rollback -c /etc/sibuna/node.json 6               # a "
"new revision with the document of 6\n"
"sibuna authority dump -c /etc/sibuna/node.json --revision 6        # "
"evaluated data; --source for the source\n"
"sibuna authority status -c /etc/sibuna/node.json                   # the "
"head and what every node applied\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock show authority                    # the "
"revision that this node serves\n"
"cat fullchain.pem privkey.pem > /etc/sibuna/certs/site.pem   # one "
"HAProxy-style bundle"
msgstr ""
"sibuna lb --bind :8080 --server 10.0.0.1:80 --server 10.0.0.2:80   # ⁧لا "
"حاجة إلى ملف⁩\n"
"sibuna lb --bind :8080 --server 10.0.0.1:80 --print-config > edge.jlv\n"
"sibuna lb --bind :8080 --server 10.0.0.1:80 --firewall shield --health "
"/healthz --admin /run/sibuna/edge.sock --access-log stdout\n"
"sibuna lb --proto tcp --bind :2222 --server 10.0.0.8:22\n"
"sibuna lb --proto udp --bind 192.0.2.10:53 --server 10.0.0.53:53       # "
"⁧يرتبط UDP بعنوان IP محدد⁩\n"
"sibuna lb --tls auto --domain example.org --server 10.0.0.1:80     # "
"⁧HTTPS التلقائي (ACME)⁩\n"
"sibuna check -f edge.jlv           # ⁧أو edge.json: التحقق من بنية النشر "
"والشهادات وملفات CA⁩\n"
"sibuna --config-file edge.jlv      # ⁧خدمة الواجهات الأمامية TCP وUDP "
"وHTTP⁩\n"
"kill -HUP \"$(pidof sibuna)\"        # ⁧إعادة تحميل المسارات والسياسة "
"والشهادات في مكانها⁩\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock show servers                      # "
"⁧يحتاج إلى global.admin_socket⁩\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock show stats                        # ⁧نص "
"Prometheus للحافة⁩\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock help                              # ⁧كل "
"الأوامر⁩\n"
"/opt/sibuna/new/sibuna --config-file edge.jlv   # ⁧مع "
"global.upgrade_socket: يستبدل البرنامج الخدمي العامل دون فقد اتصال "
"(Linux)⁩\n"
"sibuna lb --tls auto --domain localhost --server 10.0.0.1:80       # "
"⁧الشيء نفسه من السلطة المحلية⁩\n"
"sibuna lb --tls auto --domain staging.example.org --acme-issuer internal "
"--server 10.0.0.1:80   # ⁧اسم عام من السلطة المحلية⁩\n"
"sibuna lb --tls auto --domain example.org --acme-on-demand-ask "
"http://127.0.0.1:9000/ok --server 10.0.0.1:80   # ⁧أسماء أخرى عند الطلب⁩\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock show certs                        # "
"⁧شهادات tls.auto والشهادات عند الطلب، وإرفاقات OCSP الخاصة بها⁩\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock show ca > sibuna-root.crt         # "
"⁧الجذر المراد تثبيته في العملاء⁩\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock revoke cert db.corp.internal      # "
"⁧شهادة من السلطة المحلية، أو رقمها التسلسلي⁩\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock show hooks                        # "
"⁧الإضافات: الاستدعاءات، والأحكام، والإخفاقات، وقواطع الدارة المفتوحة (SID "
"0030)⁩\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock set server app/10.0.0.1:80 state drain   "
"# ⁧أو ready⁩\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock set server app/10.0.0.1:80 weight 5\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock set server app/10.0.0.1:80 state drain "
"local   # ⁧هذه العقدة فقط⁩\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock del ban 203.0.113.9                      "
" # ⁧على كل عقدة في الشبكة المتداخلة⁩\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock reload cluster                           "
" # ⁧هذه العقدة، ثم نظراؤها⁩\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock show cluster                             "
" # ⁧خلاصة الملف أو المراجعة لكل عقدة⁩\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock show affinity                            "
" # ⁧جدول التثبيت وحصص الحدود على مستوى الأسطول⁩\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock add server app/blue 10.0.0.3:80\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock del server app/blue\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock reload                            # ⁧مثل "
"SIGHUP، مع النتيجة⁩\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock reopen log                        # ⁧بعد "
"أن يعيد logrotate تسمية سجل الوصول⁩\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock show info | grep spill            # "
"⁧طبقة القرص لجدول التثبيت: الملف، والكلفة، والعدادات⁩\n"
"sibuna authority diff -c /etc/sibuna/node.json -f edge.jlv         # ⁧ما "
"سيغيّره apply في قاعدة البيانات⁩\n"
"sibuna authority apply -c /etc/sibuna/node.json -f edge.jlv --expect 7 "
"--note \"add web3\"   # ⁧نشر المراجعة 8، أو DBA002⁩\n"
"sibuna authority history -c /etc/sibuna/node.json --limit 20       # "
"⁧المراجعات، الأحدث أولًا⁩\n"
"sibuna authority rollback -c /etc/sibuna/node.json 6               # "
"⁧مراجعة جديدة بوثيقة المراجعة 6⁩\n"
"sibuna authority dump -c /etc/sibuna/node.json --revision 6        # "
"⁧البيانات المقيَّمة؛ --source للمصدر⁩\n"
"sibuna authority status -c /etc/sibuna/node.json                   # "
"⁧الرأس وما طبّقته كل عقدة⁩\n"
"sibuna ctl /run/sibuna/edge.sock show authority                    # "
"⁧المراجعة التي تخدمها هذه العقدة⁩\n"
"cat fullchain.pem privkey.pem > /etc/sibuna/certs/site.pem   # ⁧حزمة "
"واحدة بأسلوب HAProxy⁩"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:87
msgid ""
"{\n"
"  \"http\": {\"surface\": \"shield\", \"rate_limit\": 100, "
"\"rate_window\": \"10s\", \"idle_timeout\": \"15s\"},\n"
"  \"frontends\": {\n"
"    \"web\": {\"proto\": \"http\", \"binds\": [\"0.0.0.0:443\"],\n"
"            \"tls\": {\"crt\": \"/etc/sibuna/certs/\", \"http3\": true},\n"
"            \"routes\": [{\"host\": \"api.example.org\", \"backend\": "
"\"api\", \"firewall\": false}],\n"
"            \"default_backend\": \"site\"},\n"
"    \"raw\": {\"proto\": \"tcp\", \"binds\": [\"0.0.0.0:2222\"], "
"\"default_backend\": \"ssh\",\n"
"            \"rate_limit\": {\"conn_per_10s\": 60}},\n"
"    \"dns\": {\"proto\": \"udp\", \"binds\": [\"192.0.2.10:53\"], "
"\"default_backend\": \"ns\",\n"
"            \"udp_defense\": {\"mode\": \"rate_limit\", "
"\"threshold_pps\": 200}}\n"
"  },\n"
"  \"backends\": {\n"
"    \"site\": {\"mode\": \"http\", \"servers\": [{\"name\": \"s1\", "
"\"addr\": \"10.0.0.11:3000\"}]},\n"
"    \"api\": {\"mode\": \"http\", \"http_version\": \"2\", \"tls\": "
"{\"sni\": \"api.internal\"},\n"
"            \"health_check\": {\"kind\": \"http\", \"path\": "
"\"/healthz\"},\n"
"            \"servers\": [{\"name\": \"a1\", \"addr\": "
"\"10.0.0.21:8443\"}]},\n"
"    \"ssh\": {\"mode\": \"tcp\", \"servers\": [{\"name\": \"g1\", "
"\"addr\": \"10.0.0.8:22\"}]},\n"
"    \"ns\": {\"mode\": \"udp\", \"servers\": [{\"name\": \"n1\", "
"\"addr\": \"10.0.0.53:53\"}]}\n"
"  }\n"
"}"
msgstr ""

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:111
msgid ""
"``\"http\": {\"surface\": \"off\"}`` gives a load balancer with no "
"firewall. TCP and UDP frontends never use the firewall."
msgstr ""
"``\"http\": {\"surface\": \"off\"}`` يعطي موازن حمل بلا جدار ناري. ولا "
"تستخدم الواجهات الأمامية TCP وUDP الجدار الناري أبدًا."

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:113
msgid ""
"The operator console of the edge (SID 0031) needs a ``console`` section "
"in the file:"
msgstr ""
"تحتاج وحدة تحكم المشغّل للحافة (SID 0031) إلى قسم ``console`` في الملف:"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:115
msgid ""
"# console: { listen: \"127.0.0.1:9443\", data_dir: \"/var/lib/sibuna\", "
"node: 1 }\n"
"sibuna init-admin admin --data-dir /var/lib/sibuna    # once, while the "
"daemon is stopped\n"
"sibuna --config-file edge.jlv                         # then open "
"http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/ and the page Edge\n"
"curl -b \"$COOKIE\" http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/api/edge          # the "
"node, its frontends and its pools\n"
"curl -b \"$COOKIE\" http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/api/edge/fleet    # one "
"row for each member\n"
"curl -b \"$COOKIE\" -H \"X-Console-CSRF: $CSRF\" -H \"Origin: "
"http://127.0.0.1:9443\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n"
"     -d '{\"line\":\"set server app/a state drain\"}' "
"http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/api/edge/command"
msgstr ""
"# console: { listen: \"127.0.0.1:9443\", data_dir: \"/var/lib/sibuna\", "
"node: 1 }\n"
"sibuna init-admin admin --data-dir /var/lib/sibuna    # ⁧مرة واحدة، "
"والبرنامج الخدمي متوقف⁩\n"
"sibuna --config-file edge.jlv                         # ⁧ثم افتح "
"http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/ والصفحة Edge⁩\n"
"curl -b \"$COOKIE\" http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/api/edge          # "
"⁧العقدة وواجهاتها الأمامية ومجمّعاتها⁩\n"
"curl -b \"$COOKIE\" http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/api/edge/fleet    # ⁧صف "
"واحد لكل عضو⁩\n"
"curl -b \"$COOKIE\" -H \"X-Console-CSRF: $CSRF\" -H \"Origin: "
"http://127.0.0.1:9443\" -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n"
"     -d '{\"line\":\"set server app/a state drain\"}' "
"http://127.0.0.1:9443/console/api/edge/command"

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:125
msgid ""
"The command route takes ``set server ... state|weight``, ``add server``, "
"``del server``, ``del ban``, ``reload cluster`` and ``show "
"servers|cluster|certs|ca``, each with the checks of ``sibuna ctl``. It "
"needs the role of an operator."
msgstr ""
"يقبل مسار الأوامر ``set server ... state|weight`` و\\ ``add server`` و\\ "
"``del server`` و\\ ``del ban`` و\\ ``reload cluster`` و\\ ``show "
"servers|cluster|certs|ca``، كلًّا منها مع فحوص ``sibuna ctl``. ويحتاج إلى "
"دور المشغّل."

#: ../../quick-reference.rst:127
msgid ""
"Admission options of a frontend (SID 0032): ``\"defer_accept\": \"5s\"`` "
"and ``\"backlog\": 4096`` on ``tcp`` and ``http``; ``\"inspect_bytes\"`` "
"and ``\"inspect_fallback\": {\"absent\": {\"action\": \"deny\"}}`` beside "
"``tcp_inspect``; ``\"udp_inspect\": \"quic\"`` on ``udp``. All are off by "
"default."
msgstr ""
"خيارات القبول للواجهة الأمامية (SID 0032): ``\"defer_accept\": \"5s\"`` "
